Suppose:

Account A = 111122223333
Account B = 444455556666

The role exists in Account B.

Trust policy in Account B:

{
  "Version": "2012-10-17",
  "Statement": [
    {
      "Sid": "AllowAccountAToAssumeRole",
      "Effect": "Allow",
      "Principal": {
        "AWS": "arn:aws:iam::111122223333:root"
      },
      "Action": "sts:AssumeRole"
    }
  ]
}

Permissions policy in Account A for the user/role making the assumption:

{
  "Version": "2012-10-17",
  "Statement": [
    {
      "Sid": "AllowAssumeProductionRole",
      "Effect": "Allow",
      "Action": "sts:AssumeRole",
      "Resource": "arn:aws:iam::444455556666:role/ProductionDeploymentRole"
    }
  ]
}